	"system": {
		"description": "<p>At 14th level, your control over your aura is so fine you may now perform reaction combat maneuvers on behalf of allies within your aura. If the combat maneuver requires you to be within 5ft or melee range of the creature that triggered the ability, a brief illusory double of you appears within 5ft and makes an attack. The illusory double does not benefit from, or grant, flanking bonuses and disappears instantly.</p><p>In addition, your commanding aura increases to 25ft.</p>",
